Package: mayo-finder
Version: 0.1.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Jaime <info@inled.es>
Depends: libc6, libstdc++6, libsdl3-0, libfreetype6, libgl1, libfontconfig1, libdbus-1-3, hicolor-icon-theme, xdg-utils
Recommends: libvulkan1
Description: macOS Finder-style file manager for Pulsar OS (Mayonnaise)
 Icons, List and Columns views with a preview pane, background picture
 thumbnails and text page previews, Quick Look, Get Info, inline rename,
 drag and drop between folders, copy/cut/paste, Duplicate, Trash with Put
 Back and Undo, recursive search, Go to Folder and a path bar. Uses the
 freedesktop.org Trash and updates folders live (inotify). Drawn with the
 Mayonnaise C++20 UI toolkit on SDL3, using Vulkan when the GPU supports it
 and OpenGL otherwise.
